1300 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Good work, guys. Whew! We almost had to interrupt the concert!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6335:BM$="Andrew: Yeah, I was in a cold sweat. David, Alan - You'll have to try not to\get so carried away next time.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: But David needs to do that, or the audience won't get excited. I\know we can't let them get too crazy, but is it really a concert if they're\not having fun?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: I mean, even Martin was going crazy tonight. I'm almost afraid to\think of the future.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: I couldn't help it. That's just what happens when you listen to David\singing.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Damn straight. You can't tell me to keep it down. What am I supposed to\do, plug my ears? I'm pretty sure you were into it yourself, Andrew. Are\you saying it's MY fault the audience started collapsing?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1360 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: I was trying to restrain myself! I'm trying to avoid the worst-case\scenario here! But you have no self-control!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1370 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Come on guys, don't fight over this. It was mostly my fault anyway.\From now on I promise to follow your song order, okay Andrew?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1380 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Alright, let's get you back to the hotel. You're going to feel\better after a shower.":GOSUB 5100
1390 GOSUB 6150:BM$="After returning to the hotel and taking a shower, the band was able to\celebrate the success of the concert with some beer.":GOSUB 5100
1400 BM$="Once the fatigue of the concert caught up to them, they all returned to\their rooms.":GOSUB 5100
1410 BM$="Tired from all the excitement, David went to bed, forgetting about the\temptation of the visions.":GOSUB 5100
1420 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6120:BM$="The next day, the band took a bus towards their next concert site: West\Berlin.":GOSUB 5100
1425 ISET X:GOSUB 6130:BM$="They reached their hotel, aptly called `Berlin`, in the evening.":GOSUB 5100
1430 GOSUB 6140:BM$="Their concert would be held two days later. The band was chatting in a\luxurious meeting room that Susanna had arranged for them.":GOSUB 5100
