1800 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Oh, you're still up. Listen to this! I just heard there's going to be a\charity magic show at the Bristol Hotel tomorrow night.":GOSUB 5100
1810 BM$="Susanna: I was able to get five tickets. How about it? There won't be many\guests, so you should be able to relax without being bothered.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1820 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: There won't be many guests since it's for charity, but I can't\imagine it's going to be very interesting. You can't do elaborate tricks\inside a hotel.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1830 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Oh, it won't be simple magic tricks. Apparently it's some kind of\super magic show. Like, ESP. I've never seen it myself, but those who saw it\claim there's no way they're simple tricks.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1840 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: Oh, I've always been interested in ESP. Who's going to perform?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1850 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Horgen Krost. Apparently he hates television, so he will only\appear on a live stage.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1860 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: Krost? I've read about him. They say he's the Man with the Third\Eye, and that he has psychic powers. Since he can't use those power to\make money, he pretends they're magic tricks instead.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1870 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: How about it, David? You don't see actual superpowers every\day!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1880 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: If we're all going, I'm coming too. I've seen a lot of magic tricks in my\life, but actual psychic powers? That would be a first.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1890 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Sure, I'm game. I gotta see these so-called psychic powers. Honestly, I\don't really believe in ESP and the like.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1900 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: It's probably a scam, but it's not like I have anything better to do,\so why not?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1910 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Okay then! We're leaving tomorrow evening, at 6 o'clock. I've\never seen an ESPer before, so I'm looking forward to it!":GOSUB 5100
